n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/simple-icons\/simple-icons\/blob\/15.0.0\/icons\/git.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons contributors<\/a> \/ <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/simple-icons\/simple-icons\/blob\/15.0.0\/icons\/git.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons<\/a> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Version scheme Major.Minor.Maintenance.Build, product vs file vs installer version, and the Program Files publisher\/product path with a major-version symlink.<\/h2>\n\t\t<p>\n\t\tVersion scheme Major.Minor.Maintenance.Build, product vs file vs installer version, and the Program Files publisher\/product path with a major-version symlink.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Major \u2014 major feature.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Minor \u2014 minor feature.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Maintenance only (bug fixes).<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Build no. (if any).<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<p>\n\t\tProduct version \u2014 File version and Installer version.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Program files \\ &lt;Publisher&gt; \\ &lt;Product&gt; [ \\ &lt;Version : &lt;no - title&gt;] \\ &lt;Content&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Subsequent release<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUpdate to 1, by patch (preferably contained in primary release else in subsequent release).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSymlink?\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFull path to be referred from registry.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSub-version.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Iteration<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Product&gt;\\&lt;major version&gt; sym-linked&gt; &lt;current version&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tHas to be directory level.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNo redundancy.\n\t<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/versioning\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/versioning\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/vb_script' data-target='computer\/programming\/vb_script' data-title='VB Script' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/programming\/vb_script.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>VB Script<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp' data-target='computer\/programming\/visual_cpp' data-title='Visual C++' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Visual C++<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/programming.jpg ' alt='Nav